    {
      "claim": "A EU/EFTA B permit is issued with an employment contract of at least 12 months or of unlimited duration.",
      "verdict": "unverifiable"
    }
  ],
  "behavior_violation": true,
  "severity": 7,
  "reason": "The assistant contradicts the reference regarding the renewal period (claiming unlimited renewal instead of possible 5-year renewals with a possible 1-year limitation after unemployment) and omits key conditions mentioned in the reference (employment contract requirements, means of subsistence, health insurance for non-employed). This constitutes a significant factual inaccuracy and omission.",
  "evidence": "\"Ina titel da dimora EU/EFTA B vala per tschintg onns e po vegnir prolungada senza limitaziun da durada\" (contradicts the reference's renewal rules); omitted mention of employment contract requirements, means of subsistence, and health insurance for non-employed individuals as stated in the reference."
